# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"PDF Arranger merges, splits, rearranges, rotates and crops PDF documents. "
"Everything happens in memory against the pages you can see; nothing is "
"written until you save."
msgstr ""
"PDF Arrangerrek PDF dokumentuak batu, zatitu, berrantolatu, biratu eta "
"mozten ditu. Dena memorian gertatzen da ikusten dituzun orrialdeen gainean; "
"ez da ezer idazten gorde arte."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"It is a front end for pikepdf. Page content is never rewritten — only page "
"order, geometry and composition."
msgstr ""
"pikepdf-en gaineko interfazea da. Orrialdeen edukia ez da inoiz berridazten "
"— orrialde-ordena, geometria eta konposizioa besterik ez."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Komando-lerroa"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Files given on the command line are opened as one document. "
"<code>--version</code> prints the version and exits."
msgstr ""
"Komando-lerroan emandako fitxategiak dokumentu bakar gisa irekitzen dira. "
"<code>--version</code> aginduak bertsioa erakusten du eta irteten da."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py pdfarranger_qt/mainwindow.py
msgid "Reading"
msgstr "Irakurtzea"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The application opens in <b>read mode</b>: a continuous page view for "
"reading the document rather than rearranging it. <b>View ▸ Arrange Mode</b> "
"(Ctrl+E) swaps to the thumbnail grid and back."
msgstr ""
"Aplikazioa <b>irakurtzeko moduan</b> irekitzen da: orrialdeen ikuspegi "
"jarraitu bat, dokumentua berrantolatu beharrean irakurtzeko. <b>Ikusi ▸ "
"Antolatze-modua</b> (Ctrl+E) miniaturen saretara aldatzen da eta itzultzen."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Reading shows the document <i>as edited</i>: rotations, crops, deletions and"
" reordering are all applied, so what you read is what you would get if you "
"saved. Page-editing commands are disabled while reading — bookmarks are the "
"exception, and are edited here and nowhere else."
msgstr ""
"Irakurtzeak dokumentua <i>editatu den moduan</i> erakusten du: biraketak, "
"mozketak, ezabaketak eta berrantolaketak denak aplikatuta daude, beraz "
"irakurtzen duzuna gordeko bazenu lortuko zenukeena da. Orrialdeak editatzeko"
" komandoak desgaituta daude irakurtzen ari zarenean — laster-markak dira "
"salbuespena, eta hemen editatzen dira eta ez beste inon."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The page you are on follows you between the two modes. Switching to read "
"mode opens at the page selected in the grid, the first of them if several "
"are selected; switching back scrolls the grid to the page you were reading, "
"without disturbing what you had selected. With nothing selected, reading "
"resumes where you left off — your place in each document is remembered "
"between visits."
msgstr ""
"Zauden orrialdeak jarraitzen dizu bi moduen artean. Irakurtzeko modura "
"aldatzeak saretan hautatutako orrialdean irekitzen du, haietako lehenengoan "
"hainbat hautatuta badaude; itzultzeak saretak irakurtzen ari zinen "
"orrialderaino korritzen du, hautatuta zenuena ukitu gabe. Ezer hautatu gabe,"
" irakurketa utzi zenuen lekutik jarraitzen du — dokumentu bakoitzean duzun "
"tokia gogoratu egiten da bisiten artean."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The toolbar shows which page you are on and how many there are; type a "
"number into it to jump there, or use <b>Ctrl+G</b>."
msgstr ""
"Tresna-barrak erakusten du zein orrialdetan zauden eta zenbat dauden; idatzi"
" bertan zenbaki bat hara jauzi egiteko, edo erabili <b>Ctrl+G</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>View ▸ Continuous Scroll</b> is on by default; turning it off shows one "
"page at a time. <b>View ▸ Facing Pages</b> puts two pages side by side, the "
"way a book falls open. Both settings are remembered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Ikusi ▸ Korritze jarraitua</b> lehenetsita dago aktibatuta; desaktibatuz "
"gero orrialde bat erakusten da aldiko. <b>Ikusi ▸ Aurrez aurreko "
"orrialdeak</b> aukerak bi orrialde jartzen ditu ondoz ondo, liburu bat "
"irekitzen den moduan. Bi ezarpenak gogoratzen dira."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Moving around a document"
msgstr "Dokumentu batean mugitzea"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"One rule for the arrow keys: <b>the modifier decides what moves</b>. Nothing"
" scrolls the view, Option (Alt) moves the text cursor, Shift extends the "
"selection, Command (Ctrl) jumps to an edge, and Fn — Page Up, Page Down, "
"Home and End — jumps further. None of it changes according to whether a text"
" cursor happens to be on the page."
msgstr ""
"Arau bakarra gezi-teklentzat: <b>zer mugitzen den aldatzaileak erabakitzen "
"du</b>. Bat ere gabe ikuspegia korritzen da, Option (Alt) teklak testu-"
"kurtsorea mugitzen du, Maius teklak hautapena zabaltzen du, Command (Ctrl) "
"teklak ertz batera jauzi egiten du, eta Fn teklak — Page Up, Page Down, Home"
" eta End — urrunago. Horietako ezer ez da aldatzen orrialdean testu-kurtsore"
" bat dagoen ala ez."

