# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "move the text cursor, by character or line"
msgstr "mugitu testu-kurtsorea, karakterez edo lerroz"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "extend the selection, by character or line"
msgstr "zabaldu hautapena, karakterez edo lerroz"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "move the text cursor one word"
msgstr "mugitu testu-kurtsorea hitz bat"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "extend the selection one word"
msgstr "zabaldu hautapena hitz bat"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "cursor to the start / end of the line"
msgstr "kurtsorea lerroaren hasierara / amaierara"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "cursor to the start / end of the document"
msgstr "kurtsorea dokumentuaren hasierara / amaierara"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Add Shift to a Command or Option combination to extend the selection instead"
" of moving — <b>Shift+Command+→</b> selects to the end of the line. Adding "
"Option works by the word rather than the character. On Windows and Linux, "
"read Command as Ctrl and Option as Alt; the table is the same everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Gehitu Maius Command edo Option konbinazio bati hautapena zabaltzeko mugitu "
"beharrean — <b>Maius+Command+→</b> lerroaren amaieraraino hautatzen du. "
"Option gehitzeak hitzez hitz egiten du karakterez karaktere beharrean. "
"Windowsen eta Linuxen, irakurri Command Ctrl gisa eta Option Alt gisa; taula"
" bera da leku guztietan."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Selecting and copying text"
msgstr "Testua hautatzea eta kopiatzea"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag across the page to select text, across page boundaries if you keep "
"going. <b>Double-click</b> selects a word. <b>Ctrl/Cmd+C</b> copies, "
"<b>Ctrl/Cmd+A</b> selects the text of the page you are on, and <b>Esc</b> "
"clears the selection. The same commands are on the right-click menu."
msgstr ""
"Arrastatu orrialdean zehar testua hautatzeko, eta orrialde-mugetatik harago "
"jarraitzen baduzu. <b>Klik bikoitzak</b> hitz bat hautatzen du. "
"<b>Ctrl/Cmd+C</b> teklek kopiatu egiten dute, <b>Ctrl/Cmd+A</b> teklek "
"zauden orrialdeko testua hautatzen dute, eta <b>Esc</b> teklak hautapena "
"garbitzen du. Komando berak eskuineko botoiaren menuan daude."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Shift+click</b> extends an existing selection to where you clicked. The "
"end you are moving grows out to a whole word, because a single click is an "
"imprecise way to point at one character; the end you started from stays "
"exactly where you put it. Dragging selects by character throughout, since "
"you can watch it and stop where you like."
msgstr ""
"<b>Maius+klik</b> egiteak lehendik dagoen hautapena klik egin duzun lekura "
"arte zabaltzen du. Mugitzen ari zaren muturra hitz oso batera hazten da, "
"klik bakar bat karaktere bakar bat seinalatzeko modu zehaztugabea delako; "
"hasi zinen muturra jarri zenuen lekuan bertan geratzen da. Arrastatzeak "
"karakterez karaktere hautatzen du bide osoan, jarraitu eta nahi duzun lekuan"
" gelditu zaitezkeelako."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Clicking on text leaves a blinking <b>text cursor</b>. That is what "
"Shift+arrow extends from, and what the Option and Command combinations above"
" move. It stays where you put it — scrolling, paging and clicking off the "
"page all leave it alone — until you press Esc or open another document."
msgstr ""
"Testuan klik egiteak <b>testu-kurtsore</b> keinukari bat uzten du. Handik "
"zabaltzen du Maius+gezia teklak, eta hura mugitzen dute goiko Option eta "
"Command konbinazioek. Jarri zenuen lekuan geratzen da — korritzeak, "
"orrialdez aldatzeak eta orrialdetik kanpo klik egiteak ez diote ukitzen — "
"Esc sakatu edo beste dokumentu bat ireki arte."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Following links"
msgstr "Estekei jarraitzea"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Click a link to follow it. Links to a page in the same document jump there; "
"links to the web open in your browser. Hovering over one shows where it "
"goes, which is worth reading before you click: many links in a PDF are not "
"written by its author at all but inferred from the text, so what a link "
"points at is not always what the words appear to say."
msgstr ""
"Egin klik esteka batean hari jarraitzeko. Dokumentu bereko orrialde baterako"
" estekek hara jauzi egiten dute; webera doazenak zure nabigatzailean "
"irekitzen dira. Gainean jartzeak nora doan erakusten du, eta hori irakurtzea"
" merezi du klik egin aurretik: PDF bateko esteka asko ez ditu egileak "
"idatzi, testutik ondorioztatu baizik, beraz esteka batek seinalatzen duena "
"ez da beti hitzek diotela dirudiena."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Only ordinary web and mail links are handed to the system — http, https, "
"mailto and ftp. A document is a file that arrived from somewhere, and "
"anything else it asks to open is refused and reported rather than acted on."
msgstr ""
"Sistemari web eta posta esteka arruntak baino ez zaizkio ematen — http, "
"https, mailto eta ftp. Dokumentu bat nonbaitetik etorritako fitxategi bat "
"da, eta irekitzeko eskatzen duen beste edozer ukatu eta jakinarazi egiten "
"da, exekutatu beharrean."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Right-clicking a link offers <b>Open Link</b> and <b>Copy Link Address</b>."
msgstr ""
"Esteka batean eskuineko botoiaz klik eginez <b>Ireki esteka</b> eta "
"<b>Kopiatu estekaren helbidea</b> agertzen dira."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Laster-markak"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The sidebar shows the document's bookmarks. Click one to jump to it. "
"Everything below is on the sidebar's right-click menu, and every command can"
" be undone."
msgstr ""
"Alboko barrak dokumentuaren laster-markak erakusten ditu. Egin klik batean "
"hara jauzi egiteko. Beheko guztia alboko barraren eskuineko botoiaren menuan"
" dago, eta komando bakoitza desegin daiteke."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Add Bookmark Here</b> makes one pointing at the page you are reading, "
"named after whatever text you have selected — so select a heading, then add."
" With nothing selected it is named after the page. <b>Add Child Bookmark "
"Here</b> does the same, nested under the entry you clicked."
msgstr ""
"<b>Gehitu laster-marka hemen</b> aukerak irakurtzen ari zaren orrialdea "
"seinalatzen duen bat sortzen du, hautatuta duzun testuaren arabera "
"izendatuta — hautatu, beraz, izenburu bat, eta gero gehitu. Ezer hautatu "
"gabe, orrialdearen arabera izendatzen da. <b>Gehitu laster-marka umea "
"hemen</b> aukerak gauza bera egiten du, klik egin duzun sarreraren azpian "
"habiaratuta."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Rename</b> edits the title in place. <b>Re-home to This Page</b> points "
"an existing bookmark at the page you are on, keeping its title. "
"<b>Delete</b> removes an entry and <i>promotes</i> its children into its "
"place; <b>Delete with Children</b> removes the whole branch."
msgstr ""
"<b>Aldatu izena</b> aukerak izenburua bertan editatzen du. <b>Birbideratu "
"orrialde honetara</b> aukerak lehendik dagoen laster-marka bat zauden "
"orrialdera seinalarazten du, izenburua mantenduz. <b>Ezabatu</b> aukerak "
"sarrera bat kentzen du eta haren umeak haren lekura <i>igotzen</i> ditu; "
"<b>Ezabatu umeekin batera</b> aukerak adar osoa kentzen du."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag entries within the sidebar to re-nest or reorder them. <b>Expand All "
"Children</b> and <b>Collapse All Children</b> open or shut a whole branch at"
" once."
msgstr ""
"Arrastatu sarrerak alboko barraren barruan berriro habiaratzeko edo "
"berrordenatzeko. <b>Zabaldu ume guztiak</b> eta <b>Tolestu ume guztiak</b> "
"aukerek adar oso bat irekitzen edo ixten dute aldi berean."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Style</b> sets a bookmark bold or italic, or gives it a colour, as the "
"tree shows."
msgstr ""
"<b>Estiloa</b> aukerak laster-marka lodi edo etzan jartzen du, edo kolore "
"bat ematen dio, zuhaitzak erakusten duen moduan."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"A bookmark whose page has been deleted is <b>greyed out</b> rather than "
"removed: its title may still be worth keeping, and you can point it "
"somewhere else with Re-home. Undoing the deletion reconnects it. <b>Delete "
"Dangling Bookmarks</b> clears them all out; it leaves alone any entry that "
"points nowhere on purpose, which is a legitimate way to write a heading."
msgstr ""
"Orrialdea ezabatu zaion laster-marka <b>grisatu</b> egiten da kendu "
"beharrean: haren izenburuak oraindik merezi lezake gordetzea, eta beste "
"nonbaitera birbidera dezakezu. Ezabaketa desegiteak berriro lotzen du. "
"<b>Ezabatu zintzilikako laster-markak</b> aukerak denak garbitzen ditu; "
"bakean uzten du nahita inora seinalatzen ez duen edozein sarrera, hori "
"izenburu bat idazteko modu guztiz zilegia baita."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Bookmark edits are part of the document and are written when you save, along"
" with each entry's colour and style and which branches are left open. The "
"one thing that cannot be saved is a bookmark with no page: there is no way "
"to record “points at a page that is gone”, so it comes back as a heading "
"with its title intact."
msgstr ""
"Laster-marken edizioak dokumentuaren parte dira eta gordetzean idazten dira,"
" sarrera bakoitzaren kolore eta estiloarekin batera eta zein adar geratzen "
"diren irekita. Gorde ezin den gauza bakarra orrialderik gabeko laster-marka "
"da: ez dago \"desagertu den orrialde bat seinalatzen du\" idazteko modurik, "
"beraz izenburu gisa itzultzen da, izena oso-osorik."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Arranging pages"
msgstr "Orrialdeak antolatzea"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag pages to reorder them. Hold <b>Ctrl</b> while dropping to copy instead "
"of move."
msgstr ""
"Arrastatu orrialdeak berrordenatzeko. Eutsi <b>Ctrl</b> teklari askatzean "
"kopiatzeko mugitu beharrean."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag pages onto another window of the application to copy them there, or use"
" ordinary copy and paste."
msgstr ""
"Arrastatu orrialdeak aplikazioaren beste leiho batera hara kopiatzeko, edo "
"erabili ohiko kopiatu eta itsatsi."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Paste As Odd/Even Pages</b> interleaves the clipboard with the document —"
" this is how two single-sided scans of a double-sided original are "
"recombined. If the second scan came off a duplex feeder it will be in "
"reverse order; use <b>Arrange ▸ Reverse Order</b> on it first."
msgstr ""
"<b>Itsatsi orrialde bakoiti/bikoiti gisa</b> aukerak arbela dokumentuarekin "
"tartekatzen du — horrela batzen dira berriro alde bakarreko bi eskaneatze, "
"bi aldeko jatorrizko batenak. Bigarren eskaneatzea alde biko elikagailu "
"batetik atera bada, alderantzizko ordenan egongo da; erabili hari lehenik "
"<b>Antolatu ▸ Alderantzikatu ordena</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"To move pages a long way, use <b>Move to Start</b>, <b>Move to End</b> or "
"<b>Move to Page…</b> rather than dragging — in a long document the far end "
"is a great deal of scrolling away. They are on the Edit menu and on the "
"right-click menu, and <b>Move to Page…</b> asks for the number the page "
"should <i>become</i>."
msgstr ""
"Orrialdeak urrutira eramateko, erabili <b>Eraman hasierara</b>, <b>Eraman "
"amaierara</b> edo <b>Eraman orrialdera…</b> arrastatu beharrean — dokumentu "
"luze batean beste muturra korritze askora dago. Editatu menuan eta eskuineko"
" botoiaren menuan daude, eta <b>Eraman orrialdera…</b> aukerak orrialdeak "
"zein zenbaki <i>izan behar duen</i> galdetzen du."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Prefer these to cut and paste for moving. A pasted page is a <i>new</i> page"
" as far as the document is concerned, so any bookmarks pointing at the "
"original are left behind with nowhere to go. Moving keeps the page itself, "
"and its bookmarks come with it."
msgstr ""
"Mugitzeko, nahiago izan itzazu horiek ebaki eta itsatsi baino. Itsatsitako "
"orrialde bat orrialde <i>berri</i> bat da dokumentuarentzat, beraz "
"jatorrizkoa seinalatzen zuten laster-markak atzean geratzen dira nora joan "
"gabe. Mugitzeak orrialdea bera gordetzen du, eta haren laster-markak "
"berarekin datoz."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Stamping and tiling"
msgstr "Zigilatzea eta lauzatzea"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Page ▸ Add Page Numbers…</b> and <b>Page ▸ Add Watermark…</b> draw text "
"onto the selected pages. Both add a <i>layer</i> rather than rewriting the "
"page, so both can be undone and neither touches the file you opened."
msgstr ""
"<b>Orrialdea ▸ Gehitu orrialde-zenbakiak…</b> eta <b>Orrialdea ▸ Gehitu ur-"
"marka…</b> aukerek testua marrazten dute hautatutako orrialdeetan. Biek "
"<i>geruza</i> bat gehitzen dute orrialdea berridatzi beharrean, beraz biak "
"desegin daitezke eta ez batak ez besteak ez du ukitzen ireki duzun "
"fitxategia."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Page numbers follow the arrangement, not the source document: they are "
"numbered in the order the pages are in now. <code>{n}</code> in the format "
"is the page number and <code>{total}</code> the number of pages, so "
"<code>Page {n} of {total}</code> does what it looks like."
msgstr ""
"Orrialde-zenbakiek antolaketari jarraitzen diote, ez jatorrizko "
"dokumentuari: orrialdeak orain dauden ordenan zenbakitzen dira. Formatuko "
"<code>{n}</code> orrialde-zenbakia da eta <code>{total}</code> orrialde-"
"kopurua, beraz <code>{n} / {total} orrialdea</code> itxura duena egiten du."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Arrange ▸ Pages per Sheet…</b> tiles several pages onto one, in reading "
"order — the printer's <i>N-up</i>. The sheet turns sideways when that lets "
"the pages come out larger, which is why two-up gives a landscape sheet and "
"four-up does not."
msgstr ""
"<b>Antolatu ▸ Orrialdeak orriko…</b> aukerak hainbat orrialde bakar batean "
"lauzatzen ditu, irakurtzeko ordenan — inprimategiko <i>N-up</i>. Orria "
"alboka jartzen da orrialdeak horrela handiago ateratzen direnean, eta "
"horregatik ematen du bi orrialdek orri horizontal bat eta lauk ez."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Saving a document"
msgstr "Dokumentu bat gordetzea"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Optimize for the web</b> in Preferences lays the saved file out so a "
"browser can show the first page before the rest has arrived. <b>Compress</b>"
" repacks its streams and objects; how much that saves depends entirely on "
"the file, and one full of photographs will barely move."
msgstr ""
"Hobespenetako <b>Optimizatu weberako</b> aukerak gordetako fitxategia "
"antolatzen du nabigatzaileak lehen orrialdea erakutsi ahal izan dezan "
"gainerakoa iritsi aurretik. <b>Konprimatu</b> aukerak haren korronteak eta "
"objektuak berriro biltzen ditu; zenbat aurrezten den erabat fitxategiaren "
"araberakoa da, eta argazkiz betetako batek ia ez du mugitzen."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Remove All Metadata</b> is a switch, like Password: turn it on and"
" the next save writes a document with no title, no author and no record of "
"what produced it. Edit Properties greys out while it is on, because there "
"would be nothing to edit."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fitxategia ▸ Kendu metadatu guztiak</b> etengailu bat da, Pasahitza "
"bezalaxe: piztu ezazu eta hurrengo gordetzeak izenbururik, egilerik eta zerk"
" sortu zuen jasotzen ez duen dokumentu bat idatziko du. Editatu propietateak"
" grisatuta geratzen da pizturik dagoen bitartean, ez bailegoke ezer "
"editatzeko."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Viewer Preferences…</b> is how the saved document asks a reader to"
" open it — with the bookmarks showing, two pages at a time, and so on. "
"Readers are free to ignore all of it. The settings are read from the file "
"you opened, so a document that already had them keeps them."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fitxategia ▸ Ikustailearen hobespenak…</b> gordetako dokumentuak irakurle"
" bati nola ireki dezan eskatzeko modua da — laster-markak agerian, bi "
"orrialde aldiko, eta abar. Irakurleek hori guztia alde batera utz dezakete. "
"Ezarpenak ireki duzun fitxategitik irakurtzen dira, beraz lehendik zituen "
"dokumentu batek gorde egiten ditu."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Repair Document…</b> rebuilds a damaged PDF. It works on a file "
"you pick rather than the one on screen, because the file worth repairing is "
"usually one this application cannot open properly either. It reports what it"
" found before writing anything."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fitxategia ▸ Konpondu dokumentua…</b> aukerak kaltetutako PDF bat "
"berreraikitzen du. Zuk aukeratzen duzun fitxategi batean lan egiten du, ez "
"pantailan dagoenean, konpontzea merezi duen fitxategia normalean aplikazio "
"honek ere behar bezala ireki ezin duena delako. Zer aurkitu duen "
"jakinarazten du ezer idatzi aurretik."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "Sagua"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Ctrl + scroll</b> — zoom"
msgstr "<b>Ctrl + korritu</b> — zooma"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Shift + scroll</b> — scroll sideways"
msgstr "<b>Maius + korritu</b> — korritu alboetara"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Alt + scroll</b> — scroll exactly one row"
msgstr "<b>Alt + korritu</b> — korritu errenkada bat zehazki"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Double-click</b> — fit the page to the window, and back"
msgstr "<b>Klik bikoitza</b> — doitu orrialdea leihora, eta itzuli"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Click and drag</b> on empty space — rubber-band select; keep scrolling to"
" extend it"
msgstr ""
"<b>Egin klik eta arrastatu</b> leku hutsean — laukiz hautatzea; jarraitu "
"korritzen zabaltzeko"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Moving around the grid"
msgstr "Saretan mugitzea"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Arrow keys</b> move between pages, <b>Page Up</b> and <b>Page Down</b> "
"move a screenful at a time, and <b>Home</b> and <b>End</b> jump to the first"
" and last page. Hold <b>Shift</b> with any of them to extend the selection."
msgstr ""
"<b>Gezi-teklek</b> orrialdeen artean mugitzen dute, <b>Page Up</b> eta "
"<b>Page Down</b> teklek pantailakada bat aldiko, eta <b>Home</b> eta "
"<b>End</b> teklek lehen eta azken orrialdera jauzi egiten dute. Eutsi "
"<b>Maius</b> teklari haietako edozeinekin hautapena zabaltzeko."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Fit One Page</b> (F) scales so a whole page fits in the window and shows "
"one page per row — use it to work on a single page at a time. <b>Fit "
"Multiple Pages</b> (Shift+M) uses the same scale but lets as many pages sit "
"side by side as the window takes. <b>Fit Width</b> (Shift+F) fills the "
"window across instead, which shows the page wider but taller than the "
"window. Double-clicking the grid toggles Fit One Page on and off."
msgstr ""
"<b>Doitu orrialde bat</b> (F) aukerak eskalatzen du orrialde oso bat leihoan"
" sartzeko eta errenkadako orrialde bat erakusten du — erabili ezazu aldi "
"berean orrialde bakar batean lan egiteko. <b>Doitu orrialde anitz</b> "
"(Maius+M) eskala bera erabiltzen du baina leihoak onartzen dituen adina "
"orrialde uzten ditu ondoz ondo. <b>Doitu zabalerara</b> (Maius+F) leihoa "
"zeharka betetzen du, eta horrek orrialdea zabalago baina leihoa baino "
"luzeago erakusten du. Saretan klik bikoitza eginez Doitu orrialde bat piztu "
"eta itzali egiten da."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"With pages selected, all three fit the selection rather than the whole "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Orrialdeak hautatuta daudenean, hirurek hautapena doitzen dute dokumentu "
"osoa doitu beharrean."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Finding text"
msgstr "Testua bilatzea"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Find</b> selects the pages that contain the phrase and boxes each hit on "
"the thumbnail, so you can see where on the page it is. The boxes clear as "
"soon as you change the document, since the pages they were drawn for may "
"have moved."
msgstr ""
"<b>Bilatu</b> aukerak esaldia daukaten orrialdeak hautatzen ditu eta emaitza"
" bakoitza laukiztatzen du miniaturan, orrialdean non dagoen ikus dezazun. "
"Laukiak dokumentua aldatu bezain laster desagertzen dira, marraztu "
"zitzaizkien orrialdeak mugitu egin baitaitezke."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Every shortcut can be changed in <b>Edit ▸ Preferences ▸ Keyboard "
"shortcuts</b>, where they are listed under the menu each one belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Lasterbide bakoitza <b>Editatu ▸ Hobespenak ▸ Teklatuko lasterbideak</b> "
"atalean alda daiteke, non bakoitza dagokion menuaren azpian zerrendatuta "
"dagoen."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Passwords"
msgstr "Pasahitzak"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Opening an encrypted document asks for its password, which is remembered "
"until the document is closed."
msgstr ""
"Zifratutako dokumentu bat irekitzeak haren pasahitza eskatzen du, eta "
"dokumentua itxi arte gogoratzen da."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Password</b> encrypts the document when it is next saved. It is a "
"switch: turn it on and you are asked for a password, turn it off and the "
"next save is unencrypted. The password is never written to your settings, so"
" it applies to this session only — and if you forget it, the file cannot be "
"recovered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Fitxategia ▸ Pasahitza</b> aukerak dokumentua zifratzen du hurrengoan "
"gordetzean. Etengailu bat da: piztu ezazu eta pasahitz bat eskatuko zaizu, "
"itzali ezazu eta hurrengo gordetzea zifratu gabea izango da. Pasahitza ez da"
" inoiz zure ezarpenetan idazten, beraz saio honetarako baino ez da balio — "
"eta ahazten baduzu, fitxategia ezin da berreskuratu."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Files"
msgstr "Fitxategiak"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Settings are stored by Qt in the per-user location for this platform; on "
"Windows that is the registry under "
"<code>HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\pdfarranger</code>. There is no "
"configuration file to edit by hand."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpenak Qt-k gordetzen ditu plataforma honetako erabiltzaile "
"bakoitzarentzako kokapenean; Windowsen erregistroa da, "
"<code>HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\pdfarranger</code> azpian. Ez dago eskuz "
"editatzeko konfigurazio-fitxategirik."

# machine translation, unreviewed
